# Hero mobile copy (remembered)

PC keeps text burned into the hero video. Mobile needs an HTML overlay (`HeroMobileCopy` in `src/app/page.tsx`) — **currently hidden** (`SHOW_HERO_MOBILE_COPY = false`). Re-enable that flag when the user asks to show it again.

## Copy (centered, Pretendard)

1. `하나의 사건번호가 아닌,` — `font-light`
2. `한 사람의 삶` (`font-semibold`) + `으로` (`font-light`)
3. `이로운 변호사들,` — `font-light` (extra top gap)
4. `이로운 파트너스` — `font-semibold`

## Motion

- Opacity-only fade (no slide)
- Slow: `duration: 2.4`, `delay: 0.5 + i * 0.95`, `ease: "easeInOut"`
- `md:hidden` only — do not add on desktop
